# textdomain: vl_cavesounds
Turn cave sounds for yourself or another player on or off.=Slå på/av hulelyder for deg selv eller en annen spiller.

You need the debug privilege in order to turn cave sounds on or off for somebody else!=Du trenger "debug"-rettigheten for å slå hulelyder på/av for andre!

Could not find player @1!=Fant ikke spilleren @1!
off=av
on=på
Set cave sounds for @1 to: @2=Satte hulelyder for @1 til: @2
